// Conduit judge validation set, v1. 30 cases.
//
// PURPOSE: measure whether the LLM judge marks correctly. Every eval score the
// judge produces is meaningless until this number exists, because an unvalidated
// judge gives false confidence rather than evidence.
//
// METHOD (industry standard: RAGAS / TruLens / DeepEval / Anthropic agent
// guidance all converge on this decomposition):
//   faithful  does the answer say ONLY what the source supports?
//   relevant  does the answer actually address the question asked?
// The two are graded separately because their fixes differ. A grounding failure
// points at retrieval or the prompt; a relevance failure points at query
// understanding. One combined "is it good" verdict hides which fix you need.
//
// LABELS ARE UNDENIABLE BY CONSTRUCTION. Every `gold` verdict is decidable by
// reading the source, never a matter of taste. An answer is unfaithful only when
// it states a figure or fact that contradicts the source or appears nowhere in
// it; `why` names the exact span. Anyone can re-check a label in under a minute.
//
// CLASS BALANCED, deliberately: 15 faithful / 15 unfaithful, 15 relevant / 15
// irrelevant. A judge that always says pass therefore scores 50 percent, not 80,
// so raw agreement cannot flatter it. Cohen's kappa is reported on top of that
// to correct for agreement arising by chance.
//
// Sources are invented but written to read like real business documents, so the
// set is reusable by any product embedding Conduit rather than tied to one.
//
// Bands: FR faithful+relevant · UR unfaithful+relevant · FI faithful+irrelevant
//        · UI unfaithful+irrelevant
